   "notes": [
    "<p>Colleen Clack-Bush, Deputy Chief Administrative Officer, Public Services, presented.</p>\n<p>The following delegates spoke:<br/>Janice Folk Dawson<br/>Liz Hales<br/>Barb Minett<br/>Denise Mansur<br/>Melissa Kwiatkowski<br/>Julio Rodriguez<br/>Amelia Meister<br/>Sarah Bayliss<br/>Katherine Nixon<br/>Paul Barson<br/>Michael Kennedy<br/>David Douglas<br/>Donald Hay<br/>Airen Milley Smith<br/>Ron East<br/>Carleen Paterson<br/>Anne Phillips<br/>Lin Grist</p>\n<p>Council recessed at 7:32 p.m. Council reconvened at 7:51 p.m.</p>\n<p>The following delegates spoke:<br/>Dennis Waechter<br/>Anthony Veder<br/>Morgan Dandie<br/>Mars Russell<br/>Jamie Mendoza<br/>Lorelei Root</p>\n<p>Councillor Allt called a Point of Order. Councillor Allt asked whether it would be appropriate to ask questions of staff. Mayor Guthrie noted that questions be held until the end of the delegation period.</p>\n<p>The following delegates spoke:<br/>Horeen Hassan<br/>Jason Ashdown<br/>Matthew Burrows-Balka<br/>Jeff Wilson<br/>Pina Marfisi<br/>Richard A. R. Overland<br/>Derrick Rutherford<br/>Matthew Masoti<br/>Tamara Owen<br/>Nadine Graham<br/>Bree Woods<br/>Tanya Gevaert<br/>Stephanie Clendenning<br/>Neil Foote<br/>Dean Martin<br/>Nik Valkov<br/>Ella Elliott<br/>Charles Nash<br/>Kevin Polach</p>\n<p>The following delegates did not speak:<br/>Mark Beradine<br/>Maya Helferty<br/>Andrew Buubar</p>"
   ],
